%%report tenant-created-per-month title: Tenants created per month entity: Tenant chart: line x: month y: records help: Legal and operational boundary for participating education organizations. New tenants per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_tenant WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report tenant-age-bands title: How recently tenants were changed entity: Tenant chart: bar x: last_changed y: records help: Legal and operational boundary for participating education organizations. Records by time since their last change; the oldest band is the stale tail to review or retire. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '30 days' THEN 'last 30 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '90 days' THEN '30 to 90 days' WHEN updated_at >= now() - interval '180 days' THEN '90 to 180 days' ELSE 'older than 180 days' END AS last_changed, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_tenant WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MIN(updated_at) DESC
%%report tenant-top-country-code title: Tenants: the most common country code entity: Tenant chart: bar x: country_code y: records help: Legal and operational boundary for participating education organizations. The ten most frequent values of country code among tenants; free text that repeats is a list the model could close. sql: SELECT COALESCE(country_code, '(blank)') AS country_code, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_tenant WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report institution-by-institution-type title: Institutions by institution type entity: Institution chart: pie x: institution_type y: records help: Accredited organization administering programs and credentials. How institutions divide across institution type, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(institution_type::text, '(unset)') AS institution_type, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_institution WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
