%%report recruitment-campaign-campaign-budget-by-channel title: Total campaign budget by channel entity: RecruitmentCampaign chart: bar x: channel y: total_campaign_budget help: Planned outreach designed to attract eligible prospective learners. Recruitment Campaigns added up on campaign budget, split by channel, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(channel::text, '(unset)') AS channel, ROUND(SUM(campaign_budget)::numeric, 2) AS total_campaign_budget FROM bus_recruitment_campaign WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
%%report recruitment-campaign-campaign-budget-per-month title: Average campaign budget per month entity: RecruitmentCampaign chart: line x: month y: average_campaign_budget help: Planned outreach designed to attract eligible prospective learners. The average campaign budget of recruitment campaigns created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(campaign_budget)::numeric, 2) AS average_campaign_budget FROM bus_recruitment_campaign WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report recruitment-campaign-largest-by-campaign-budget title: The ten largest recruitment campaigns by campaign budget entity: RecruitmentCampaign chart: bar x: record y: campaign_budget help: Planned outreach designed to attract eligible prospective learners. The records with the highest campaign budget; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT name::text AS record, campaign_budget FROM bus_recruitment_campaign WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND campaign_budget IS NOT NULL ORDER BY campaign_budget DESC LIMIT 10
