%%report learning-course-credit-units-per-month title: Average credit units per month entity: LearningCourse chart: line x: month y: average_credit_units help: Reusable course specification including academic credit and learning outcomes. The average credit units of learning courses created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(credit_units)::numeric, 2) AS average_credit_units FROM bus_learning_course WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
