%%report learner-plan-course-per-learner-program-plan title: Learner Plan Courses per learner program plan entity: LearnerPlanCourse chart: bar x: learner_program_plan y: records help: Individual planned course that contributes toward a student program plan, with desired delivery term and completion tracking. Which learner program plan the most learner plan courses belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS learner_program_plan, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_learner_plan_course x LEFT JOIN bus_learner_program_plan p ON p.id = x.learner_program_plan_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
