%%report transfer-credit-credits-by-status title: Total credits by status entity: TransferCredit chart: bar x: status y: total_credits help: Recognized credit from previous study subject to equivalency and academic approval, with provenance retained for transcript review. Transfer Credits added up on credits, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(credits)::numeric, 2) AS total_credits FROM bus_transfer_credit WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
