%%report learning-achievement-score-per-learner-profile title: Total score per learner profile entity: LearningAchievement chart: bar x: learner_profile y: total_score help: Evidence that a learner met a defined outcome or earned an academic achievement after assessment. Learning Achievements added up on score for each learner profile, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.learner_number::text, '(none)') AS learner_profile, ROUND(SUM(x.score)::numeric, 2) AS total_score FROM bus_learning_achievement x LEFT JOIN bus_learner_profile p ON p.id = x.learner_profile_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
