%%report assessment-grade-points-per-month title: Average points per month entity: AssessmentGrade chart: line x: month y: average_points help: Instructor evaluation of a submission. The average points of assessment grades created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(points)::numeric, 2) AS average_points FROM bus_assessment_grade WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
