%%report assessment-grade-points-per-assessment-submission title: Total points per assessment submission entity: AssessmentGrade chart: bar x: assessment_submission y: total_points help: Instructor evaluation of a submission. Assessment Grades added up on points for each assessment submission, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.submission_url::text, '(none)') AS assessment_submission, ROUND(SUM(x.points)::numeric, 2) AS total_points FROM bus_assessment_grade x LEFT JOIN bus_assessment_submission p ON p.id = x.assessment_submission_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
