%%report gift-designation-created-per-month title: Gift Designations created per month entity: GiftDesignation chart: line x: month y: records help: Approved philanthropic purpose or restricted funding account used to attribute gifts to permitted expenditure. New gift designations per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_designation WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report gift-designation-restricted-share title: Gift Designations: restricted entity: GiftDesignation chart: pie x: restricted y: records help: Approved philanthropic purpose or restricted funding account used to attribute gifts to permitted expenditure. The share of gift designations where restricted holds against those where it does not. sql: SELECT CASE WHEN restricted THEN 'yes' ELSE 'no' END AS restricted, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_designation WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report gift-designation-per-institution title: Gift Designations per institution entity: GiftDesignation chart: bar x: institution y: records help: Approved philanthropic purpose or restricted funding account used to attribute gifts to permitted expenditure. Which institution the most gift designations belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS institution, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_designation x LEFT JOIN bus_institution p ON p.id = x.institution_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report gift-commitment-by-status title: Gift Commitments by status entity: GiftCommitment chart: pie x: status y: records help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. How gift commitments divide across status, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report gift-commitment-lifecycle title: Gift Commitment lifecycle entity: GiftCommitment chart: bar x: state y: records help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. Where gift commitments sit in their state machine, in the order the diagram draws it; a state nothing has reached shows as zero. sql: SELECT d.state, COALESCE(c.records, 0) AS records FROM (SELECT 'pledge_recorded' AS state, 0 AS position UNION ALL SELECT 'pledge_active', 1 UNION ALL SELECT 'pledge_fulfilled', 2 UNION ALL SELECT 'pledge_cancelled', 3) d LEFT JOIN (SELECT status AS state, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1) c ON c.state = d.state ORDER BY d.position
%%report gift-commitment-created-per-month title: Gift Commitments created per month entity: GiftCommitment chart: line x: month y: records help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. New gift commitments per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report gift-commitment-pledge-date-per-month title: Gift Commitments by pledge date entity: GiftCommitment chart: line x: month y: records help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. Gift Commitments grouped by the month of pledge date, looking two years back and one ahead. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', pledge_date), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND pledge_date IS NOT NULL AND pledge_date >= now() - interval '24 months' AND pledge_date < now() + interval '12 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report gift-commitment-pledged-amount-by-status title: Total pledged amount by status entity: GiftCommitment chart: bar x: status y: total_pledged_amount help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. Gift Commitments added up on pledged amount, split by status, to show where the quantity sits. sql: SELECT COALESCE(status::text, '(unset)') AS status, ROUND(SUM(pledged_amount)::numeric, 2) AS total_pledged_amount FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST
%%report gift-commitment-pledged-amount-per-month title: Average pledged amount per month entity: GiftCommitment chart: line x: month y: average_pledged_amount help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. The average pledged amount of gift commitments created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(pledged_amount)::numeric, 2) AS average_pledged_amount FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report gift-commitment-largest-by-pledged-amount title: The ten largest gift commitments by pledged amount entity: GiftCommitment chart: bar x: record y: pledged_amount help: Pledge by a donor with value and schedule; it is not yet a settled gift transaction. The records with the highest pledged amount; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT status::text AS record, pledged_amount FROM bus_gift_commitment WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND pledged_amount IS NOT NULL ORDER BY pledged_amount DESC LIMIT 10
