%%report inventory-item-largest-by-quantity-on-hand title: The ten largest inventory items by quantity on hand entity: InventoryItem chart: bar x: record y: quantity_on_hand help: Tracked campus stock keeping unit, used for issue, replenishment and loss monitoring. The records with the highest quantity on hand; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT name::text AS record, quantity_on_hand FROM bus_inventory_item WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND quantity_on_hand IS NOT NULL ORDER BY quantity_on_hand DESC LIMIT 10
%%report inventory-item-reorder-level-per-month title: Average reorder level per month entity: InventoryItem chart: line x: month y: average_reorder_level help: Tracked campus stock keeping unit, used for issue, replenishment and loss monitoring. The average reorder level of inventory items created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(reorder_level)::numeric, 2) AS average_reorder_level FROM bus_inventory_item WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report inventory-item-largest-by-reorder-level title: The ten largest inventory items by reorder level entity: InventoryItem chart: bar x: record y: reorder_level help: Tracked campus stock keeping unit, used for issue, replenishment and loss monitoring. The records with the highest reorder level; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT name::text AS record, reorder_level FROM bus_inventory_item WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND reorder_level IS NOT NULL ORDER BY reorder_level DESC LIMIT 10
