%%report stock-movement-quantity-per-month title: Average quantity per month (Stock Movement) entity: StockMovement chart: line x: month y: average_quantity help: Auditable receipt, issue or transfer adjusting stock quantity; a correction uses a reversing movement. The average quantity of stock movements created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(quantity)::numeric, 2) AS average_quantity FROM bus_stock_movement WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report stock-movement-largest-by-quantity title: The ten largest stock movements by quantity entity: StockMovement chart: bar x: record y: quantity help: Auditable receipt, issue or transfer adjusting stock quantity; a correction uses a reversing movement. The records with the highest quantity; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT reference::text AS record, quantity FROM bus_stock_movement WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND quantity IS NOT NULL ORDER BY quantity DESC LIMIT 10
