%%report journal-line-per-journal-entry title: Journal Lines per journal entry entity: JournalLine chart: bar x: journal_entry y: records help: One debit or credit posting in a journal, classified to the approved general ledger account. Which journal entry the most journal lines belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.reference::text, '(none)') AS journal_entry, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_journal_line x LEFT JOIN bus_journal_entry p ON p.id = x.journal_entry_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
