%%report policy-created-per-month title: Policies created per month entity: Policy chart: line x: month y: records help: Approved institution governance rule with effective date and responsible authority. New policies per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_policy WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
