%%report data-retention-policy-retention-days-per-month title: Average retention days per month entity: DataRetentionPolicy chart: line x: month y: average_retention_days help: Approved rule defining how long each class of student or institutional data is kept and when erasure is lawful. The average retention days of data retention policies created each month, to see whether the typical record is growing or shrinking. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, ROUND(AVG(retention_days)::numeric, 2) AS average_retention_days FROM bus_data_retention_policy WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report data-retention-policy-largest-by-retention-days title: The ten largest data retention policies by retention days entity: DataRetentionPolicy chart: bar x: record y: retention_days help: Approved rule defining how long each class of student or institutional data is kept and when erasure is lawful. The records with the highest retention days; worth reading for outliers and for the few that carry most of the total. sql: SELECT name::text AS record, retention_days FROM bus_data_retention_policy WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND retention_days IS NOT NULL ORDER BY retention_days DESC LIMIT 10
