%%report report-execution-per-report-definition title: Report Executions per report definition entity: ReportExecution chart: bar x: report_definition y: records help: Auditable instance of an analytics run used to detect errors, unauthorized access or slow-running queries. Which report definition the most report executions belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS report_definition, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_report_execution x LEFT JOIN bus_report_definition p ON p.id = x.report_definition_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report report-execution-row-count-per-report-definition title: Total row count per report definition entity: ReportExecution chart: bar x: report_definition y: total_row_count help: Auditable instance of an analytics run used to detect errors, unauthorized access or slow-running queries. Report Executions added up on row count for each report definition, ten largest first. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS report_definition, ROUND(SUM(x.row_count)::numeric, 2) AS total_row_count FROM bus_report_execution x LEFT JOIN bus_report_definition p ON p.id = x.report_definition_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC NULLS LAST LIMIT 10
%%report dashboard-by-audience-type title: Dashboards by audience type entity: Dashboard chart: pie x: audience_type y: records help: Organized view of institution-level indicators scoped to the viewer role and security context. How dashboards divide across audience type, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(audience_type::text, '(unset)') AS audience_type, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dashboard WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report dashboard-created-per-month title: Dashboards created per month entity: Dashboard chart: line x: month y: records help: Organized view of institution-level indicators scoped to the viewer role and security context. New dashboards per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dashboard WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report dashboard-per-institution title: Dashboards per institution entity: Dashboard chart: bar x: institution y: records help: Organized view of institution-level indicators scoped to the viewer role and security context. Which institution the most dashboards belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS institution, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dashboard x LEFT JOIN bus_institution p ON p.id = x.institution_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
%%report dashboard-widget-by-visualization-type title: Dashboard Widgets by visualization type entity: DashboardWidget chart: pie x: visualization_type y: records help: Individual visual tied to a validated report definition; never expose unrestricted query results through a public dashboard. How dashboard widgets divide across visualization type, so the dominant group and the empty ones are both visible. sql: SELECT COALESCE(visualization_type::text, '(unset)') AS visualization_type, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dashboard_widget WHERE deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC
%%report dashboard-widget-created-per-month title: Dashboard Widgets created per month entity: DashboardWidget chart: line x: month y: records help: Individual visual tied to a validated report definition; never expose unrestricted query results through a public dashboard. New dashboard widgets per month over two years - the volume the business actually handles. sql: SELECT to_char(date_trunc('month', created_at), 'YYYY-MM') AS month, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dashboard_widget WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND created_at >= now() - interval '24 months' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1
%%report dashboard-widget-per-dashboard title: Dashboard Widgets per dashboard entity: DashboardWidget chart: bar x: dashboard y: records help: Individual visual tied to a validated report definition; never expose unrestricted query results through a public dashboard. Which dashboard the most dashboard widgets belong to; the head of the list is the concentration to know about. sql: SELECT COALESCE(p.name::text, '(none)') AS dashboard, COUNT(*) AS records FROM bus_dashboard_widget x LEFT JOIN bus_dashboard p ON p.id = x.dashboard_id AND p.deleted_at IS NULL WHERE x.deleted_at IS NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 10
