flowchart TD
A([Start: Validate StudentInvoice]) --> B{Invalid amount?}
B -->|Yes| C([End: Reject invalid value])
B -->|No| D([End: Accept valid value])
%%action rejectUpdateRequirePositiveInvoice validation-error when: total < 0 message: Invoice total cannot be negative; issue a separate credit adjustment.

