B -->|Yes| C([End: Reject invalid value])
B -->|No| D([End: Accept valid value])
%%action rejectUpdateRequirePositiveRefund validation-error when: amount <= 0 message: Refund amount must be greater than zero and must not exceed the original settled payment.

